The two .wasm files in this folder are the WebAssembly backend of TensorFlow.js,
copied unchanged from the npm package @tensorflow/tfjs-backend-wasm 4.22.0
(dist/tfjs-backend-wasm.wasm and dist/tfjs-backend-wasm-simd.wasm).

Copyright 2019 Google LLC. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

They are served from this site so the face check never asks a CDN for them.
The threaded build is left out: it needs a cross-origin isolated page, which
this site is not.
